      "content": "the \"support tools\" don't change the numbers though. a hotline won't pay the rent or stop interest from accruing. it just feels like people try to patch up the person so they can go back to being a cog in the machine. it's like, why bother trying to \"fix\" me just so i can keep drowning in a system that's clearly broken? it feels more like being told to keep swimming in a storm that never ends.",
